{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07890","headline":"宴张记室宅 · 孟浩然","name":"宴张记室宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲第金张馆，门庭车骑多。\n家封汉阳郡，文会楚材过。\n曲岛浮觞酌，前山入咏歌。\n妓堂花映发，书阁柳逶迤。\n玉指调筝柱，金泥饰舞罗。\n宁知书劒者，岁月独蹉跎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}